{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't get enough of Hunters, Inc ? Want to support further development of the game AND get your big green mitts on some flash bits to show off to da boyz? Then feast your eyes on these Guildmaster Gobbo approved cosmetics!\u00a0 <br> <br>Including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exclusive gold plated armor (with tasteful black accents) for each class!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special golden weapon skins for every weapon the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our sincere thanks and appreciation for helping us keep making the games we love!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A GOLDEN HAT FOR PORKY !!!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMPORTANT NOTE:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buying this DLC is really a way for you to show your support for the game, and us the developers. Think of the cosmetic items as a nice bonus that is only available to supporters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845540?t=1751332089","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845540?t=1751332089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845540/c36b8dd2311342865065e75df6de0bbbd57ffc97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751332089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845540/c36b8dd2311342865065e75df6de0bbbd57ffc97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751332089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can't get enough of Hunters, Inc ? Want to support further development of the game AND get your big green m